    "name": "Brushwood Saga",
    "steam_appid": 2622110,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622110/extras/9fc63c4ad1f2b1788dfa52278563885b.avif?t=1709298712\" width=648 height=106 /></span><br><br><strong>Brushwood Saga</strong> is a High Fantasy Role Playing Game (RPG) made in RPG Maker MV. Using familiar turn-based combat with intricate mana and stamina systems, you'll get to explore a wide world of wonders beset by rampaging monsters, vile cults, and war, with certain choices made along the way that may affect how your story ends. Play as Lyle Brushwood, the son of a legendary hero with a personality as sweet and charming as he is naive and lightheaded. Join up with eccentric companions and take down greater evils, strengthening the bonds between yourself and your newfound comrades.<br><br><u>This Game Features:</u><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>12 hours of RPG Gameplay</li><li>Challenging bonus dungeons</li><li>7 playable characters </li><li>Damage Element System, with different enemies vulnerable to different attacks</li><li>Over 100 different types of enemies!]</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622110/extras/9fc63c4ad1f2b1788dfa52278563885b.avif?t=1709298712\" width=648 height=106 /></span><br><br><strong>Brushwood Saga</strong> is a High Fantasy Role Playing Game (RPG) made in RPG Maker MV. Using familiar turn-based combat with intricate mana and stamina systems, you'll get to explore a wide world of wonders beset by rampaging monsters, vile cults, and war, with certain choices made along the way that may affect how your story ends. Play as Lyle Brushwood, the son of a legendary hero with a personality as sweet and charming as he is naive and lightheaded. Join up with eccentric companions and take down greater evils, strengthening the bonds between yourself and your newfound comrades.<br><br><u>This Game Features:</u><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>12 hours of RPG Gameplay</li><li>Challenging bonus dungeons</li><li>7 playable characters </li><li>Damage Element System, with different enemies vulnerable to different attacks</li><li>Over 100 different types of enemies!]</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A simple adventure made in RPG Maker MV featuring turn-based combat, unique player characters, and plenty of dungeon crawling in a light-hearted adventure that steadily takes darker turns.",
